<title>USA: Glendale School District, Pa., adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>Glendale School District, Pa., adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Glendale School District, Pa., said Monday it recalculated Prudential Securities Inc's winning bid on the District's $3 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 5.3113 percent reflecting the cost of insurance, not the true interest cost of 5.279 originally calculated.</p>
</text>
